{"articleNo":"115811","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=115811&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[전자의료기기인력양성사업]UCSD(University of California, San Diego) 학생교류 및 전공체험 설명회 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.10.15","hit":"2542","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>UCSD(University of California, San Diego) 학생교류 및 전공체험 설명회 안내</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">본 첨단의료기기연구소에서는 \"UCSD 학생교류 및 전공체험 설명회\"를 아래와 안내하오니, 관심있는 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">1. </span>강 연 자 <span lang=\"EN-US\">: </span>황정주박사<span lang=\"EN-US\"> (UCSD, California Institute for Telecommunications and Information Technology (Calit2) Director)</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2. </span>일&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 시 : <font color=\"#0900ff\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">2014</span>년<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 10</span>월21일(화)<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>오후<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>시<span lang=\"EN-US\">-</span>오후<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>시<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></strong></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">3. </span>장&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 소 <span lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><font color=\"#0900ff\"><strong>글로벌관<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 415</span>호<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></strong></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">4. </span>주&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 제 <span lang=\"EN-US\">: UCSD </span>학생교류 및 전공체험 설명회<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">5. </span>대&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 상 <span lang=\"EN-US\">:&nbsp;UCSD </span>학생교류 참여 희망자(참여를 희망하거나 관심이 있는 학생 누구나)</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">6. </span>후&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 원 <span lang=\"EN-US\">: </span>전자의료기기사업단</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
